            Before choosing a size, write down everything that will draw power on a typical day, how much power it draws, and for how long. The camping version of this list is different from the home version: no refrigerators or sump pumps, but a lot of small rechargeable batteries and one or two loads that run all day and all night. The figures below are typical ranges drawn from common device ratings, not measurements of any one product, so check the label on your own gear.
          </p>

