              <p class="text-[#38BDF8] font-black text-xs uppercase tracking-widest mb-2">Comparison</p>
              <h3 class="text-gray-900 font-bold text-lg group-hover:text-[#1E90FF] transition-colors">EcoFlow vs. Jackery</h3>
              <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm mt-2">The two biggest power station brands compared on expansion, charging and ecosystem.</p>
